    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reanalyse blinded embryo-level defect calls for untreated, nicotine, and nicotine-plus-HCN2 groups, testing both the reduction from about 60% to 6% and equivalence of rescue to the approximately 7% control level.";
